    "用你的星光\n叫醒 Pibo。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wake Pibo\nwith your starlight."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用你的星光\n叫醒 Pibo。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "运动会变成活力星光，睡眠会变成静息星光。Pibo 会因为这些光保持清醒。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Movement becomes Vitality Starlight. Sleep becomes Rest Starlight. These lights keep Pibo awake."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "运动会变成活力星光，睡眠会变成静息星光。Pibo 会因为这些光保持清醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pibo 会读取（不写入）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pibo reads, but never writes"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pibo 会读取（不写入）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
