    "很久以前，Pibo 们在没有太阳的地方等待光。它们不记得自己从哪里来，只记得契约会在黑暗里发亮。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Long ago, Pibos waited for light where there was no sun. They forgot where they came from, but remembered contracts glow in the dark."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "很久以前，Pibo 们在没有太阳的地方等待光。它们不记得自己从哪里来，只记得契约会在黑暗里发亮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "铃声不是为了命令谁回来。它只是告诉迷路的人，仍然有人在等。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bell was not meant to order anyone back. It only told the lost that someone was still waiting."
