    },
    "第一周已经完成。接下来可以扩展饰品、归巢和更多记忆碎片。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The first week is complete. Next can come accessories, homing, and more memory fragments."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第一周已经完成。接下来可以扩展饰品、归巢和更多记忆碎片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你今天走了很多路，我身上一直亮着。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You walked a lot today. I have been glowing the whole time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你今天走了很多路，我身上一直亮着。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "星光很暖。我想多醒一会儿。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The starlight is warm. I want to stay awake a little longer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "星光很暖。我想多醒一会儿。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "昨晚的静息星光很稳，我醒来的时候没有害怕。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last night's Rest Starlight was steady. I was not afraid when I woke."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "昨晚的静息星光很稳，我醒来的时候没有害怕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今天刚刚好。我能清醒地陪你一阵。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today is just right. I can stay awake with you for a while."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今天刚刚好。我能清醒地陪你一阵。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "星光不多不少，像一盏小灯。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The starlight is just enough, like a small lamp."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "星光不多不少，像一盏小灯。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我把今天记下来了。契约还在发光。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I wrote today down. The contract is still glowing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我把今天记下来了。契约还在发光。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我有点困，但还能听见你。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I am a little sleepy, but I can still hear you."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我有点困，但还能听见你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今天的星光很轻。我可能会慢一点回应。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today's starlight is light. I may answer a little slowly."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今天的星光很轻。我可能会慢一点回应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你不用一下子做很多，让光回来一点就好。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You do not have to do a lot at once. Just let a little light return."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你不用一下子做很多，让光回来一点就好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我睡了一会儿。醒来的时候，壳里很安静。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I slept for a while. When I woke, the shell was very quiet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我睡了一会儿。醒来的时候，壳里很安静。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如果你今天走一小段路，我应该能睁开眼。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you take a short walk today, I should be able to open my eyes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果你今天走一小段路，我应该能睁开眼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "沉睡不是结束。我只是离声音远了一点。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deep sleep is not the end. I am only a little farther from sound."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沉睡不是结束。我只是离声音远了一点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "壳里很安静。我还听得见你，别一下子做太多。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It is quiet inside the shell. I can still hear you. Do not do too much at once."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "壳里很安静。我还听得见你，别一下子做太多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "门后的星声，又近了一点。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The star-sounds behind the door came a little closer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "门后的星声，又近了一点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我梦见了很多星壳，它们都没有名字。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I dreamed of many star shells. None of them had names."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我梦见了很多星壳，它们都没有名字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "归巢不是死亡。可我还不想回去。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homing is not death. But I do not want to go back yet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "归巢不是死亡。可我还不想回去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有些光不是照亮路的，是用来记住人的。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Some light is not for lighting the road. It is for remembering people."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有些光不是照亮路的，是用来记住人的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今日步骤": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
