    "它是四月中旬来的那只。你刚跑完步的时候它跳得最高，你工作开会的时候它就安静地守着。它还年轻，还在学你的节奏。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It arrived in mid-April. It jumped highest right after your runs, and quietly stayed by you during work meetings. It is still young and still learning your rhythm."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它是四月中旬来的那只。你刚跑完步的时候它跳得最高，你工作开会的时候它就安静地守着。它还年轻，还在学你的节奏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
